1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,110
Empezamos en el sudeste de Asia,

2
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:03,370
en Laos:

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:04,530
el khao niao,

4
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:06,570
un arroz glutinoso al vapor,

5
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:09,170
neutro, que se come con la mano haciendo

6
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:12,310
bolitas para agarrar larb o ensalada de papaya.

7
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,370
Subimos a Asia Central,

8
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:15,850
a Tayikistán:

9
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:19,130
el qaroqurut, un queso seco hecho con suero,

10
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:20,290
ácido y salado,

11
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:21,630
que se come como snack.

12
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:23,590
Seguimos al Báltico,

13
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:24,510
a Estonia:

14
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:27,770
la kama, una papilla de harinas tostadas,

15
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:29,630
avena, centeno y arvejas,

16
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:31,410
con suero de leche o kéfir,

17
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:33,790
para el desayuno o de postre con frutas.

18
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:35,930
Viajamos a Noruega:

19
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:39,310
la agurksalat, una ensalada fresca de pepino con

20
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:41,530
vinagre, azúcar y perejil,

21
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:43,270
ideal con salmón o caballa.

22
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:45,450
Bajamos al norte de África,

23
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:46,310
a Túnez:

24
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:49,150
la shakshuka, salada y picante,

25
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:51,150
huevos pochados en salsa de tomate,

26
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:52,390
con pan para mojar.

27
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:55,050
Y terminamos en África Occidental,

28
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:55,830
en Ghana:

29
00:00:56,160 --> 00:00:58,970
el funje, un puré de mandioca neutro y

30
00:00:58,980 --> 00:01:01,370
suave que se come con una salsa picante.

